---
import StudioLayout from "../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
---
<StudioLayout title="Vidéo" code="VIDEO">
<section class="head"><div><div class="eyebrow">VIDEO LAB // 006</div><h1>RÉALISATION VIDÉO</h1></div><div class="headmeta">PROJET / <span data-active-project>—</span><br/>AGNES / <span data-video-provider-state>CHECK…</span></div></section>
<div class="notice" data-video-message><strong>Agnes :</strong> vérification de la configuration serveur…</div>
<div class="notice" data-agnes-queue-state><strong>File Agnes :</strong> initialisation…</div>
<div class="notice" data-agnes-quota><strong>Budget IA Cloudflare :</strong> chargement…</div>
<div class="notice video-project-warning" data-video-project-warning hidden><strong>Aucun projet actif :</strong> la réalisation est verrouillée. <a href="/studio/projets/">Sélectionner, restaurer ou créer un projet →</a></div>

<section class="panel work-context">
<div class="panel-title"><span>01 / MATIÈRE DE L’ŒUVRE</span><span class="dim">CONTEXTE CRÉATIF</span></div>
<div class="context-grid">
<div class="context-card"><span>TITRE</span><b data-active-project>—</b><small>BASE PROJETS</small></div>
<div class="context-card"><span>PAROLES / TEXTE</span><b data-work-text-state>CHECK…</b><small data-work-text-meta>TEXTE CLOUD</small></div>
<div class="context-card"><span>IMAGES</span><b data-work-image-state>CHECK…</b><small data-work-image-meta>MÉDIATHÈQUE</small></div>
<div class="context-card"><span>AUDIO</span><b data-work-audio-state>CHECK…</b><small data-work-audio-meta>MÉDIATHÈQUE</small><div><button type="button" data-master-audio-button>IMPORTER LE MASTER AUDIO</button><input type="file" data-master-audio-input accept="audio/wav,audio/x-wav,audio/mpeg,audio/mp3,audio/mp4,audio/aac,audio/flac,.wav,.mp3,.m4a,.aac,.flac" hidden></div></div>
</div>
<div class="analysis-actions"><button class="studio-button inline" type="button" data-analyse-work>ANALYSER L’ŒUVRE AVEC L’IA</button><span data-analysis-state>CLOUDFLARE WORKERS AI · DIRECTOR</span></div>
</section>

<div class="director-grid">
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-title"><span>02 / DIRECTION CRÉATIVE</span><span class="dim">BRIEF RÉALISATEUR</span></div>
<div class="director-body">
<label>INTENTION<textarea data-director-intent placeholder="Ex. rupture nocturne, retenue, solitude, réalisme, pas de lip-sync…"></textarea></label>
<div class="director-summary" data-analysis-summary><div class="empty-state">Analyse l’œuvre pour construire le brief à partir du titre, du texte et des assets disponibles.</div></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-title"><span>03 / RÉFÉRENCES VISUELLES</span><span class="dim">CANON DU PROJET</span></div>
<div class="storyboard" data-visual-references><div class="empty-state">Le Director proposera ici les personnages, lieux, styles et objets nécessaires.</div></div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-title"><span>04 / STORYBOARD</span><span class="dim">PLAN PAR PLAN</span></div>
<div class="storyboard" data-storyboard><div class="empty-state">Le storyboard sera construit ici avant l’envoi des plans à Agnes.</div></div>
</section>
</div>

<div class="video-grid">
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>05 / GÉNÉRER UN PLAN</span><span class="dim">AGNES VIDEO</span></div><form class="video-form" data-video-form>
<label>PROMPT DU PLAN<textarea data-video-prompt required placeholder="Le prompt d’un plan précis, enrichi par la direction créative…"></textarea></label>
<div class="video-options"><label>FORMAT<select data-video-format><option value="9:16">9:16 · VERTICAL</option><option value="16:9">16:9 · HORIZONTAL</option></select></label><label>MODÈLE<input value="agnes-video-2.5-flash" readonly/></label><label>DURÉE<input value="5 s · 720P" readonly/></label></div>
<div class="plan-references"><span>CANON VISUEL DU PLAN</span><div data-plan-references><div class="empty-state">Aucun canon validé.</div></div></div><label>KEYFRAME CANONIQUE<select data-plan-keyframe><option value="">AUCUN · MODE TEXTE/RÉFÉRENCE</option></select></label><label class="check-line"><input type="checkbox" data-video-audio/> GÉNÉRER L’AUDIO</label>
<label data-video-audio-style-wrap hidden>STYLE AUDIO<input data-video-audio-style value="acoustic experimental intellectual ambient, soft textures, no drums"/></label>
<button class="studio-button" type="submit" data-video-generate>AJOUTER À LA FILE AGNES</button>
</form></section>
<aside class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>PRODUCTION</span><span class="dim">SERVER SIDE</span></div><div class="services"><div class="service"><span>AGNES</span><span data-video-provider-state>CHECK…</span></div><div class="service"><span>FILE D’ATTENTE</span><span>1 JOB ACTIF MAX.</span></div><div class="service"><span>CLÉ API</span><span data-video-key-state>SERVER SECRET</span></div><div class="service"><span>ARCHIVAGE</span><span>MÉDIATHÈQUE</span></div><div class="service"><span>MÉTADONNÉES</span><span>BASE PROJETS</span></div><div class="service"><span>WAN / VIDU</span><span class="status standby">STANDBY</span></div></div></aside>
<section class="panel video-history-panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>06 / GÉNÉRATIONS</span><span class="dim"><span data-count="videos">00</span> JOBS</span></div><div class="video-history" data-video-history><div class="empty-state">Aucune génération.</div></div></section>
</div>
</StudioLayout>